        "id": 14851,
        "quiz_id": 3529,
        "type": "writing",
        "title": "Some people think secondary school students should study international news as one of their subjects, while others believe that this is a waste of valuable school time? Discuss both these views and give your own opinion.",
        "status": "draft",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zsz1d5v9eoZRWDxYsmPllF7yglh\"><em><strong>Some people think secondary school students should study international news as one of their subjects, while others believe that this is a waste of valuable school time? Discuss both these views and give your own opinion.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - International News in School<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong> <a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JOLBdddUioAJO5xtJi4lonAsg6c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Đề International News in School&nbsp;cho 2 quan điểm:</strong> Một số người cho rằng học sinh trung học n&ecirc;n học thời sự quốc tế như một trong số những m&ocirc;n học bắt buộc<em> (Quan điểm 1)</em>, trong khi một số người kh&aacute;c cho rằng việc n&agrave;y l&atilde;ng ph&iacute; thời gian học tập qu&yacute; b&aacute;u<em> (Quan điểm 2)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GH1vdN7A1o1tdYxL5oulQyS5grc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Thảo luận cả hai quan điểm v&agrave; đưa ra &yacute; kiến của bạn.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J3a4dpNqWo8cG4x5gNxlIxMmghd\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i International News in School&nbsp;v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UDXHdqRgDofe0Kx7Q2AlrpaJgic\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1: </strong>Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XwLhdnmbKoeAV1xlTLHlxvwjgwe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2: </strong>Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XgVQdg0ALoWKWhx7nIolxyQVglc\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BKzkdYnlho2ci0x9fY1la8ISgJh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>be exposed to global news <em>(tiếp cận tin tức thời sự to&agrave;n cầu)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AUxLdwnbKof5AxxE7qFlhlHMgTg\">\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pklmddy9Bo7tzyxz8N8lq70Dgyb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FpNbd7IdBoA4Ctx6gxsl4JN5gie\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OWsUdfdiSo5zJSxHBAElqPqPgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnoWda9NLoogFOxHQgvljDWwgQI\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0VTdv3RjoVBMUxyY6glDwkugHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xxw3dzwzloLfvMx31Ozl4U5Rgdd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GNJ6d5ipHoc8XKxmUm7lK2WGgfe\">Bạn n&ecirc;n thảo luận mỗi quan điểm v&agrave; đưa ra &yacute; kiến c&aacute; nh&acirc;n của m&igrave;nh về việc ủng hộ quan điểm n&agrave;o. Ở đ&acirc;y, theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>&nbsp;với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong>, YouPass sẽ nghi&ecirc;ng về quan điểm thứ 2, v&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh tin rằng <strong>'mặc d&ugrave; việc học thời sự quốc tế c&oacute; những lợi &iacute;ch nhất định, việc đưa n&oacute; th&agrave;nh một m&ocirc;n học ri&ecirc;ng biệt c&oacute; thể kh&ocirc;ng phải l&agrave; c&aacute;ch tiếp cận hiệu quả nhất. </strong>Với c&aacute;ch lập luận n&agrave;y, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ sắp xếp &yacute; tưởng v&agrave;o 2 BODY như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KKfEde5hcodvCJxV8OjlFnidgxb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 1:</strong> M&igrave;nh sẽ đ&oacute;ng vai ng&ocirc;i thứ 3: b&agrave;n về một số những lợi &iacute;ch m&agrave; việc học thời sự quốc tế c&oacute; thể mang lại.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZSeNdSgrPogun4xsPUslktx2gub\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 2:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm của ri&ecirc;ng c&aacute; nh&acirc;n m&igrave;nh: nh&agrave; trường kh&ocirc;ng n&ecirc;n biến việc học thời sự quốc tế th&agrave;nh một m&ocirc;n học ri&ecirc;ng biệt.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6xsduRXyo7PgoxfRdNlJsyWgCb\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZCi8dUtrIoNNTTx7gl3llDpYgUL\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cau-truc-doan-van\" target=\"_self\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jvy7dry7XoJRCyx1bgulj2smgZf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-reason-impact\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-example\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 1: </strong>B&agrave;n về một số những lợi &iacute;ch m&agrave; việc học thời sự quốc tế c&oacute; thể mang lại.</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGx2dtMsVo2SRMxTaHOlDGY0gIh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OUsndgv96oXwDFxW1FrloHVrgAe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GRTBdEWugofGoixOPJblvMOygNU\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CqPEd28cco0ycmxZHuQlljkHgMe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4nldWXyRoUmvgxl7nOldzdAgIf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CizadgB9moHAc1xIKRIlK0EVgAz\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Topic sentence:</span> </strong>Kh&ocirc;ng thể phủ nhận rằng tin tức thời sự quốc tế gi&uacute;p học sinh <em>mở rộng tầm nh&igrave;n (broaden their horizons)</em> về thế giới xung quanh.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KXlPdz6p2oIK5Qxee4zlC7YzgSf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TBfldRwAConhFqx3b1NlSVKigkW\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1: </strong>Khi được tiếp x&uacute;c với c&aacute;c sự kiện quan trọng như <em>xung đột ch&iacute;nh trị (political conflicts)</em>, <em>xu hướng kinh tế (economic trends)</em> hay <em>c&aacute;c vấn đề m&ocirc;i trường to&agrave;n cầu (glocal environmental issues)</em>, học sinh sẽ c&oacute; cơ hội hiểu hơn về thế giới m&agrave; họ đang sống.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Om9NdzVVqoML2ex68nXlpHRogHb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact: </strong><em>Việc nắm bắt (grasping) </em>c&aacute;c mối quan hệ phức tạp giữa c&aacute;c quốc gia v&agrave; hiểu được c&aacute;ch c&aacute;c quyết định ở một nơi c&oacute; thể ảnh hưởng đến cuộc sống ở nơi kh&aacute;c sẽ gi&uacute;p học sinh chuẩn bị tốt hơn cho vai tr&ograve; c&ocirc;ng d&acirc;n<em> trong một x&atilde; hội to&agrave;n cầu h&oacute;a (in a globalized society).</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R0vudpJLjoXN91xXM1elSR5LgKd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R3xvdimK1o8jc0x8ewoliQaSgie\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2</strong>: việc ph&acirc;n t&iacute;ch tin tức cũng gi&uacute;p học sinh ph&aacute;t triển tư duy phản biện khi họ phải đ&aacute;nh gi&aacute; nguồn th&ocirc;ng tin v&agrave; <em>nhận diện c&aacute;c thi&ecirc;n kiến (identify biases)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OnUadH9nBovm20xrr6OlN3NygKh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Example:</strong> khi so s&aacute;nh <em>c&aacute;ch đưa tin về c&ugrave;ng một sự kiện (coverage of the same event)</em> từ c&aacute;c nguồn kh&aacute;c nhau, học sinh sẽ r&egrave;n luyện kỹ năng ph&acirc;n biệt giữa sự thật v&agrave; <em>&yacute; kiến chủ quan (subjective opinions), </em>gi&uacute;p họ trở th&agrave;nh <em>những người tiếp nhận th&ocirc;ng tin s&aacute;ng suốt hơn (more discerning consumers of information)</em> trong thời đại m&agrave; <em>th&ocirc;ng tin sai lệch (misinformation)</em> lan truyền nhanh ch&oacute;ng.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 2: </strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm c&aacute; nh&acirc;n rằng nh&agrave; trường kh&ocirc;ng n&ecirc;n biến việc học thời sự quốc tế th&agrave;nh một m&ocirc;n học ri&ecirc;ng biệt</span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KrtVdtupRoKL6sxjDB2lsqewgkf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IpmcdM2KVo20yvx1AcclbEoFgNe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdeNdWsDkoHkxfxFq99lekOpgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zq8Ed5ZPxoJixmxjWwPlsAd9gQ8\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9QVdRGxLozW5JxLNrOlZt4TgTh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ec7GdL8hOopk25xWQG2llrpWgfd\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Topic sentence:</span> </strong>Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, việc bổ sung th&ecirc;m một m&ocirc;n học mới v&agrave;o chương tr&igrave;nh <em>đ&atilde; qu&aacute; tải (overloaded) </em>l&agrave; điều đ&aacute;ng c&acirc;n nhắc.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JkMJdY0q4o0o66x2Z32l8T7IgYf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OFLRd6RltoEAnVxk3gXlAe3Zg0t\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1</strong>: Học sinh trung học hiện đ&atilde; phải <em>đối mặt với &aacute;p lực (face pressure)</em> từ nhiều m&ocirc;n học cơ bản như to&aacute;n, khoa học v&agrave; ngoại ngữ.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XaBFd6MDVoMEdLxorYnljgDCgib\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact: </strong>Việc th&ecirc;m một m&ocirc;n học nữa sẽ l&agrave;m giảm thời gian d&agrave;nh cho c&aacute;c m&ocirc;n học quan trọng n&agrave;y v&agrave; c&oacute; thể <em>g&acirc;y qu&aacute; tải (overwhelm)</em> cho học sinh.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZHUJdgA9bogF4BxIL5Plx1d2gTc\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KSjVdSDAwoKxJ2xtpArlnkJrg7d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2</strong>: Thay v&agrave;o đ&oacute;, một giải ph&aacute;p hiệu quả hơn l&agrave; <em>t&iacute;ch hợp (integrate)</em> tin tức quốc tế v&agrave;o c&aacute;c m&ocirc;n học hiện c&oacute;.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DWGxdP8wjoLB13xZI8xlNBuwgLe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Example:</strong> V&iacute; dụ, gi&aacute;o vi&ecirc;n c&oacute; thể đưa c&aacute;c sự kiện thời sự v&agrave;o b&agrave;i giảng x&atilde; hội học, hay thảo luận về c&aacute;c vấn đề to&agrave;n cầu trong giờ địa l&yacute;., điều n&agrave;y kh&ocirc;ng chỉ gi&uacute;p học sinh <em>kết nối kiến thức với bối cảnh thực tế (connect knowledge to real-world contexts)</em> m&agrave; c&ograve;n tr&aacute;nh được việc l&agrave;m qu&aacute; tải chương tr&igrave;nh học.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx3IdxsyToocMyxrcHBlR5M4gTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z215dilK9oetfOxPDFol02JKgkg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JRbGdLxfwoyo3LxfaWvlKYZxgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S41gdx1Yho0RQhxH1Zclco4KgPH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MDkodyWDGo2nbTx3llNlDkiTgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bx6adWi8AoLDF0xo9FAl8FSSgig\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt c&aacute;c luận điểm ch&iacute;nh v&agrave; khẳng định lại quan điểm</strong> của m&igrave;nh nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y8BQdjdJpoQrfPx05RflH4ZCgZd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y9fPdPnSgocAg4xKCh0l7PFLg5b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">a seperate subject <em>(một m&ocirc;n học ri&ecirc;ng biệt)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 861,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RUmoddsjpogXlLxFwE0lAoyTgiV\">Opinions are divided whether secondary school students should study international news as a separate subject. Although being exposed to global news offers certain benefits to students, I believe that making it a standalone subject may not be the most effective approach.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14851,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 862,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F46Dd13i6oR2C1xVMTSll3ypgY1\"><strong>Admittedly, international news helps students broaden their horizons about the world around them.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">When exposed to important events such as political conflicts, economic trends, or global environmental issues, students have opportunities to better understand the world they live in. Grasping the complex relationships between nations and understanding how decisions in one place can affect lives elsewhere will help students better prepare for their role as citizens in a globalized society</span>. <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Furthermore, analyzing news also helps students develop critical thinking as they evaluate information sources and identify biases. For instance, when comparing coverage of the same event from different sources, students sharpen their skills in distinguishing between facts and subjective opinions, which allows them to become more discerning consumers of information in an age where misinformation spreads rapidly.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14851,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 863,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DXhtdk8AAolmYOxzeMrlMXE9gdb\"><strong>However, adding another subject to an already overloaded curriculum deserves careful consideration.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">Secondary school students currently face pressure from many core subjects like mathematics, science, and foreign languages. Adding another subject would reduce time for these important subjects and could overwhelm students</span>. <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Instead, a more effective solution is to integrate international news into existing subjects. For example, teachers can incorporate current events into social studies lessons or discuss global issues in geography classes. This approach not only helps students connect knowledge to real-world contexts but also avoids overloading the curriculum.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14851,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 864,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UipId91MfoYvIIxZOxOlWU8vgdL\">In conclusion, although international news plays an important role in broadening perspectives and developing critical thinking for students, making it a separate subject may not be necessary. I believe that appropriately incorporating news content into existing subjects will bring higher educational effectiveness and avoid putting unnecessary pressure on the curriculum.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14851,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
